{
  "_id": "259EzPfnSUaKOrNL1S2bpIpMdKl",
  "_type": "Docs",
  "_index": "a2",
  "title": "Workspaces and roots",
  "navigationTitle": "",
  "body": [
    {
      "_type": "paragraph",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "content": [
        {
          "_type": "text",
          "text": "A workspace is a separate set of content with its own content directory and "
        },
        {
          "_type": "text",
          "text": "roots",
          "marks": [
            {
              "_type": "link",
              "_id": "2c5D0rdh3wpYg35vLkio0mOCncI",
              "_link": "entry",
              "_entry": "28hcdyq0sGJdgY6kM24NZd1XP5S"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "text",
          "text": ". Most sites need one. Add more to manage several websites, or clearly separate areas such as a website and an app, from one dashboard: editors switch between them in the sidebar."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "CodeBlock",
      "_id": "267Q4Kyg9hOUVaJWolmaa1wOndr",
      "code": "import {Config} from 'alinea'\nimport {createCMS} from 'alinea/next'\nimport * as schema from './schema'\n\nexport const cms = createCMS({\n  schema,\n  workspaces: {\n    main: Config.workspace('My site', {\n      source: 'content',\n      mediaDir: 'public/media',\n      color: '#3F61E8',\n      roots: {\n        // Website pages\n        pages: Config.root('Pages', {contains: ['Page', 'Blog']}),\n        // Uploaded images and files\n        media: Config.media()\n      }\n    })\n  },\n  handlerUrl: '/api/cms'\n})",
      "fileName": "cms.ts",
      "language": "tsx"
    },
    {
      "_type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "_type": "text",
          "text": "Options"
        }
      ],
      "_anchor": "configuration"
    },
    {
      "_type": "paragraph",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "content": [
        {
          "_type": "text",
          "text": "`Config.workspace(label, options)` takes the label shown in the dashboard and:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "bulletList",
      "content": [
        {
          "_type": "listItem",
          "content": [
            {
              "_type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "_type": "text",
                  "text": "`source` (required): the directory, relative to your project, where the workspace's content files are stored."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "listItem",
          "content": [
            {
              "_type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "_type": "text",
                  "text": "`roots` (required): the "
                },
                {
                  "_type": "text",
                  "text": "roots",
                  "marks": [
                    {
                      "_type": "link",
                      "_id": "3JkF0BSphtZqgB7ffoAAgQUXbsA",
                      "_link": "entry",
                      "_entry": "28hcdyq0sGJdgY6kM24NZd1XP5S"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "_type": "text",
                  "text": " of the workspace, keyed by name. Add a "
                },
                {
                  "_type": "text",
                  "text": "media root",
                  "marks": [
                    {
                      "_type": "link",
                      "_id": "3JkF0B4acu8fhJpceN9DPB4sSwp",
                      "_link": "entry",
                      "_entry": "2aB45fUcIgu0Wx0NMULlU8VH7KK"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "_type": "text",
                  "text": " to allow uploads."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "listItem",
          "content": [
            {
              "_type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "_type": "text",
                  "text": "`mediaDir`: the directory where uploaded files are stored, such as `public/media`. Keep it inside your public folder (`public`, or the "
                },
                {
                  "_type": "text",
                  "text": "`publicDir`",
                  "marks": [
                    {
                      "_type": "link",
                      "_id": "2aB37bqwCoFd6oFLcZmHCOgUcSJ",
                      "_link": "entry",
                      "_entry": "259Ey7LXgqL7ZDGJ8XK1vBJmZrh"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "_type": "text",
                  "text": " you configured): media urls point to `/admin/file/...`, and the handler serves them from the public copy of the file."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "listItem",
          "content": [
            {
              "_type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "_type": "text",
                  "text": "`mediaUrl`: a prefix for the workspace's media urls, for example `'shop'` gives `/admin/file/shop/logo.png`. Useful when several workspaces have files with the same name."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "listItem",
          "content": [
            {
              "_type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "_type": "text",
                  "text": "`color`: the accent color of the workspace in the dashboard. By default a color is derived from the label."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "listItem",
          "content": [
            {
              "_type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "_type": "text",
                  "text": "`icon`: a React component shown next to the workspace name."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "listItem",
          "content": [
            {
              "_type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "_type": "text",
                  "text": "`preview`: turn "
                },
                {
                  "_type": "text",
                  "text": "live previews",
                  "marks": [
                    {
                      "_type": "link",
                      "_id": "3JkF091B7u5zsgriMZbKmvb5d8o",
                      "_link": "entry",
                      "_entry": "2YlBsRF2vZwxcS27oOSJYmQM37q"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "_type": "text",
                  "text": " on or off for everything in this workspace, or pass a component that renders the preview."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "paragraph",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "content": [
        {
          "_type": "text",
          "text": "The key of a workspace (`main`) is its name in content and queries. Like type names, it has to start with a letter and contain only letters, digits and underscores."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "paragraph",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "content": [
        {
          "_type": "text",
          "text": "Don't change the `mediaDir` of a workspace that already has uploads: media entries store the location of their file relative to it."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "_type": "text",
          "text": "Several workspaces"
        }
      ],
      "_anchor": "roots"
    },
    {
      "_type": "paragraph",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "content": [
        {
          "_type": "text",
          "text": "With more than one workspace, every `source` directory must be named after its workspace key, and they must all be in the same parent directory:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "CodeBlock",
      "_id": "3JkF09EOTeyQRa04TVx8zbiVODE",
      "code": "import {Config} from 'alinea'\nimport {createCMS} from 'alinea/next'\nimport * as schema from './schema'\n\nexport const cms = createCMS({\n  schema,\n  workspaces: {\n    main: Config.workspace('Website', {\n      source: 'content/main',\n      mediaDir: 'public/media/main',\n      roots: {\n        pages: Config.root('Pages'),\n        media: Config.media()\n      }\n    }),\n    docs: Config.workspace('Documentation', {\n      source: 'content/docs',\n      mediaDir: 'public/media/docs',\n      roots: {\n        pages: Config.root('Pages'),\n        media: Config.media()\n      }\n    })\n  },\n  handlerUrl: '/api/cms'\n})",
      "fileName": "cms.ts",
      "language": "tsx"
    },
    {
      "_type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "_type": "text",
          "text": "All workspaces share the schema. Limit which types can be created where with the `contains` option of each root, and which editors can access a workspace with "
        },
        {
          "_type": "text",
          "text": "roles",
          "marks": [
            {
              "_type": "link",
              "_id": "3JkF089Q2j6tihBD5uR5VOy38Pr",
              "_link": "entry",
              "_entry": "3AhqfX37Pijf2zOEwYVVU4NmdHG"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "text",
          "text": "."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "_type": "text",
          "text": "Entry urls don't include the workspace, so give each workspace its own routes, or use "
        },
        {
          "_type": "text",
          "text": "`entryUrl`",
          "marks": [
            {
              "_type": "link",
              "_id": "3JkF07IEXGWIWrOKSdA4TJLpg9d",
              "_link": "entry",
              "_entry": "267QuOShP41WnFxQFOcHZQoCsla"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "text",
          "text": " to add a prefix."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "_type": "text",
          "text": "Querying a workspace"
        }
      ],
      "_anchor": "querying-a-workspace"
    },
    {
      "_type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "_type": "text",
          "text": "Workspaces and roots are available on your CMS instance, so you can scope queries without repeating names:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "CodeBlock",
      "_id": "3JkF0BX4ZgGbFwzckHQBaTflFIK",
      "code": "import {cms} from '@/cms'\nimport {Query} from 'alinea'\n\nconst pages = await cms.find({\n  workspace: cms.workspaces.main,\n  select: {title: Query.title, url: Query.url}\n})",
      "fileName": "",
      "language": "tsx"
    },
    {
      "_type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "_type": "text",
          "text": "Pass a root such as `cms.workspaces.main.pages` to `root` or `location` to narrow it down further, see "
        },
        {
          "_type": "text",
          "text": "Querying",
          "marks": [
            {
              "_type": "link",
              "_id": "3JkF08QjT8LsuCsSHrHbjGjP1Bd",
              "_link": "entry",
              "_entry": "3AUAiIoQhl86EKefhuhZ6EThETv"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "text",
          "text": "."
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
